'''Hangar Six'''<ref name="TFNn">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens (novelization)|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' novelization]]</ref> was a [[hangar]] bay located onboard the [[First Order]]'s<ref name="TFA" /> [[Resurgent-class Star Destroyer|''Resurgent''-class Star Destroyer]] ''[[Finalizer]]''.<ref name="TFAVD" /> In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="SWGA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> the [[Resistance]] [[pilot]] [[Poe Dameron]] and the [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtrooper]] [[Finn]] stole<ref name="TFA" /> a [[Unidentified TIE/sf space superiority fighter (Finalizer)|TIE/sf space superiority fighter]]<ref name="TFAVD" /> from [[Bay Two]] of the hangar and, after firing upon the other occupants of the hangar while detaching the [[starfighter]]'s [[fuel]] cable, the pair managed to escape the [[Star Destroyer]]<ref name="TFA" /> into the [[Jakku system]].<ref name="SWGA" />

